{"name":"Loafer","hex":"#dbd9c2","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"loafer","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["An idle person.","A shoe with no laces, resembling a moccasin."]},{"part":"Verb","definitions":["To loaf around; to be idle."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/loafer"}],"entries":[{"title":"Loafer (2015 film)","blocks":[{"text":"Loafer is a 2015 Indian Telugu-language action drama film written and directed by Puri Jagannadh. It stars Varun Tej and Disha Patani while Revathi and Posani Krishna Murali appear in crucial supporting roles. The film was officially launched on 8 July 2015 in Hyderabad."}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/9/97/Loafer_Movie_Poster.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Loafer_(2015_film)","wikidata":"Q21427700"},{"title":"Loafer (1996 film)","blocks":[{"text":"Loafer is a 1996 Indian Hindi-language masala film directed by David Dhawan and produced by Surinder Kapoor and Boney Kapoor. It stars Anil Kapoor and Juhi Chawla in pivotal roles. The film was a remake of the 1990 Tamil film Velai Kidaichuduchu."}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/7/7f/Loafer_1996_film_poster.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Loafer_(1996_film)","wikidata":"Q6663408"},{"title":"Slip-on shoe","blocks":[{"text":"Slip-ons are typically low, lace-less shoes. The style which is most commonly seen, known as a loafer, slippers, or penny loafers in American culture, has a moccasin construction. One of the first designs was introduced in London by Wildsmith Shoes, called the Wildsmith Loafer. They began as casual shoes, but have increased in popularity to the point of being worn in America with business suits. Another design was introduced as the Aurlandskoen in Norway."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/com